msgstr ""
"``django.contrib.auth.hashers.SHA1PasswordHasher``, "
"``django.contrib.auth.hashers.UnsaltedSHA1PasswordHasher``, dan "
"``django.contrib.auth.hashers.UnsaltedMD5PasswordHasher`` akan dihapus."

msgid ""
"The model ``django.contrib.postgres.fields.CICharField``, "
