msgid "The ``django.contrib.postgres.fields.CIText`` mixin will be removed."
msgstr "Mixin ``django.contrib.postgres.fields.CIText` akan dihapus."

msgid ""
"The ``map_width`` and ``map_height`` attributes of ``BaseGeometryWidget`` "
"will be removed."
msgstr ""
"Atribut ``map_width`` dan ``map_height`` dari ``BaseGeometryWidget`` akan "
"dihapus."

msgid "The ``SimpleTestCase.assertFormsetError()`` method will be removed."
msgstr "Metode ``SimpleTestCase.assertFormsetError()`` akan dihapus."

msgid ""
"The ``TransactionTestCase.assertQuerysetEqual()`` method will be removed."
msgstr "Metode ``TransactionTestCase.assertQuerysetEqual()`` akan dihapus."

